      "control_name": "CloudFront to S3 Origin Uses HTTP",
      "control_description": "CloudFront distribution fetches objects from S3 via HTTP, not HTTPS. Traffic between CloudFront and S3 is unencrypted. The user sees HTTPS in the browser but the backend fetch is plaintext — the same false-HTTPS pattern as Cloudflare Flexible SSL mode.\n",
